# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: hardn's main menu on its layout, its status$
# read from the gallery's hardened Debian 13 host; its 3 the$
# real DNS screen, on another Debian 13 host; its 1, 2 and 5$
# Figma's screen mocks, under dry run after a note of what$
# origin/main does there; its 4, under dry run, origin/main's$
# Firewall screen as it prints. Nothing on this machine changes.$
$
hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
# Debian 13 (Trixie) ###########################################$
